<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Pray to labor with the Lord,</l><l>Be identified with Him</l><l>In His purpose and His aim</l><l>Till His blessing floodeth in.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Pray to labor with the Lord;</l><l>Self-ambition and self-will</l><l>We must ever cast away,</l><l>All His purpose to fulfill.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Pray to labor with the Lord;</l><l>Let the Lord initiate</l><l>All the plan and all the work;</l><l>Then thru us He’ll operate.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Pray to labor with the Lord</l><l>Till the wheel begins to move;</l><l>Pray together with the Lord</l><l>Till the Church His pow’r shall prove.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
